      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "扇动着翅膀……不久，便开始飞越海洋。\n仿佛每次扇动都在恢复力量，一点点地，一点点地——",
      "source_fingerprint": "139bcead27b199aac6df9f8ea089a7ab75591291a2712c42c95f0a949dbd384c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
