      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "蝴蝶的翅膀又柔软、又娇小。\n可是……谁又能断定它飞不过大海呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7acc17654bbe4c90859a023bd7b68aa313dd251f2de925fca01b383c393e8313",
