      "source_text": "在那么激烈的训练中不断逼迫自己，\n甚至还漂亮地完成了海外复仇……这样的她？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1afa58182d01e5c4b5e7119f9892c76b234baaf80194c8e381aaca8bd6246d52",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
