    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1a6ec0fc55cf863fb02f781",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我一直以为她是个身心素质都极为强大的孩子。\n——不，她的身体素质非常出色这点毋庸置疑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d8425cb2096573cb863bec1e3fedc0b50921743901942bef629aade6fb79b53",
